# HOOKS.md

Automated guardrails from the agentic-workflow plugin. Where they execute differs
per harness:

- **Claude Code:** hooks run **from this project** — scripts are symlinked at
  `.claude/hooks/` and wired in `.claude/settings.json` (both created by bootstrap).
- **Cursor:** hooks execute **from the installed plugin**, not from this project — do
  not add a project-local `.cursor/hooks/hooks.json` expecting it to run.
  `.cursor/hooks/` contains read-only symlinks for browsing only.

| Location | Path |
|---|---|
| Claude Code (active) | `.claude/hooks/*.sh` + `.claude/settings.json` |
| Cursor plugin (active) | `~/.cursor/plugins/local/agentic-workflow/hooks/` |
| Cursor in-repo (reference) | `.cursor/hooks/` — symlinks only |

## What runs when

| Script | Cursor event | Claude Code event | Effect |
|---|---|---|---|
| `dep-age-guard.sh` | `beforeShellExecution` | `PreToolUse` (Bash) | Blocks `npm`/`pnpm`/`yarn`/`bun`/`pip` installs of packages published <14 days ago |
| `format-changed.sh` | `afterFileEdit` | `PostToolUse` (Edit\|Write) | Best-effort Prettier on the edited file; never fails the turn |
| `run-tests.sh` | `stop` | `Stop` | Runs the project test suite (npm/pnpm/yarn/bun/pytest); on failure blocks the stop in Claude Code (exit 2) so the agent keeps fixing. `RUN_TESTS_SKIP=1` bypasses |

## Wiring (reference)

Claude Code (`.claude/settings.json` — written by bootstrap if absent; merge this
block manually if you already had a settings file):

```json
{
  "hooks": {
    "PreToolUse": [
      { "matcher": "Bash", "hooks": [ { "type": "command", "command": "\"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR\"/.claude/hooks/dep-age-guard.sh" } ] }
    ],
    "PostToolUse": [
      { "matcher": "Edit|Write", "hooks": [ { "type": "command", "command": "\"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR\"/.claude/hooks/format-changed.sh" } ] }
    ],
    "Stop": [
      { "hooks": [ { "type": "command", "command": "\"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR\"/.claude/hooks/run-tests.sh" } ] }
    ]
  }
}
```

Cursor (`hooks.json`, lives in the plugin):

```json
{
  "version": 1,
  "hooks": {
    "beforeShellExecution": [ { "command": "./hooks/dep-age-guard.sh" } ],
    "afterFileEdit":        [ { "command": "./hooks/format-changed.sh" } ],
    "stop":                 [ { "command": "./hooks/run-tests.sh" } ]
  }
}
```

A symlink to the Cursor wiring is at `.cursor/hooks/hooks.json`.

## Scripts (symlinked)

- `.claude/hooks/` and `.cursor/hooks/`: `dep-age-guard.sh`, `format-changed.sh`,
  `run-tests.sh`

Override the symlink source with `AGENTIC_WORKFLOW_HOOKS=/path/to/hooks` (Cursor) or
`AGENTIC_WORKFLOW_CLAUDE_PLUGIN=/path/to/plugins/core-workflow` (Claude Code) if needed.
